{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>And on the day of the first-fruits.</b> The festival of Shavuot is called ״בכורי קציר חטים״ on account of the two loaves, for they are the first-fruits of the meal-offering of wheat that comes from the new crop." "<b>And you should reflect</b> on why here, regarding the goat of Atzeret, it did not mention חטאת, as it mentioned for all the appointed times in this parashah. And the reason for this by way of the plain sense (peshat) is that Atzeret is the season of the giving of the Torah, and there Israel were as one born without sin." "<b>And by way of the Kabbalah</b> it alludes to the Atzeret of the world, in which the evil impulse will be utterly abolished and the fence of its stones demolished."], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:36:45.391822473Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}